==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 0.33~0.67 seconds<sup>10f~20f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 0.33~0.67 seconds<sup>10f~20f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 0.33~0.67 seconds<sup>10f~20f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 0.33~0.67 seconds<sup>10f~20f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 0.33~0.67 seconds<sup>10f~20f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a pretty regular pure Aku stage. The goal is to outlast the 8 Aku Gories and the Miz Devil waves.
Bring some anti-Aku meatshields like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bellydance Cat]] or [[Cat Cactus]], something to damage the Gories and Miz Devils such as [[Can Can Cat]], [[Fiend Cat]] or [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]]. A [[Shield Piercing]] unit to deal with Le'Behemoth and Wicked face, [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]] can do the job, [[Barrel Cat]] does as well.

==Trivia==
*[[Cradle Shrine (Deadly)/Aku|Bad Instinct's Origin]], Bad Instinct's Apex and [[Frontier Shrine (Merciless)/Aku|Bad Instinct's Refuge]] are the only [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] [[Enigma Stages]] not to follow the "X Cradle, X Summit, X Frontier" naming scheme for their maps.
*The "Instinct" in Bad Instinct's Origin, Bad Instinct's Apex and Bad Instinct's Refuge refers to Instinct Orbs, a literal translation of Talent Orbs' Japanese name (本能玉 ''Hon'nō-dama'').

